  "unresolved": [
    "Natural scheduling into the typed origin 11064 is not established: the only record naming 23M is in GROUND.MES's own opaque tail, and what schedules the caller into it and this guard is not measured.",
    "What sets global_u8[396] and global_u8[1778] is not established.",
    "The callee writes banked_u16[242] = 23, read here as the map word; it also sets global_u8[1755], which every C guard on this map and 17M's EVENTC10 require clear, and its own done flag global_u8[1782].",
    "The affection word banked_u16[206] is above 70 for this guard's own bar and below 71 for the spring C rungs' bar (EVENTC02/EVENTC05 per the group's caller premises) - what moves it is not measured.",
    "The GROUND.MES continuation past the handoff is not measured.",
